, USA.</Affiliation></AffiliationInfo></Author><Author ValidYN="Y"><LastName>Bhaduri</LastName><ForeName>Aparna</ForeName><Initials>A</Initials><AffiliationInfo><Affiliation>Department of Neurology, University of California, San Francisco (UCSF), San Francisco, CA 94122, USA.</Affiliation></AffiliationInfo></Author><Author ValidYN="Y"><LastName>Meyers</LastName><ForeName>Jordan M</ForeName><Initials>JM</Initials><AffiliationInfo><Affiliation>Program in Epithelial Biology, Stanford University School of Medicine, Stanford, CA 94305, USA.</Affiliation></AffiliationInfo></Author><Author ValidYN="Y"><LastName>Rovira-Clav&#233;</LastName><ForeName>Xavier</ForeName><Initials>X</Initials><AffiliationInfo><Affiliation>Department of Microbiology &amp; Immunology, Stanford University School of Medicine, Stanford, CA 94305, USA.</Affiliation></AffiliationInfo></Author><Author ValidYN="Y"><LastName>Hollmig</LastName><ForeName>S Tyler</ForeName><Initials>ST</Initials><AffiliationInfo><Affiliation>Program in Epithelial Biology, Stanford University School of Medicine, Stanford, CA 94305, USA.</Affiliation></AffiliationInfo></Author><Author ValidYN="Y"><LastName>Aasi</LastName><ForeName>Sumaira Z</ForeName><Initials>SZ</Initials><AffiliationInfo><Affiliation>Program in Epithelial Biology, Stanford University School of Medicine, Stanford, CA 94305, USA.</Affiliation></AffiliationInfo></Author><Author ValidYN="Y"><LastName>Nolan</LastName><ForeName>Garry P</ForeName><Initials>GP</Initials><AffiliationInfo><Affiliation>Department of Microbiology &amp; Immunology, Stanford University School of Medicine, Stanford, CA 94305, USA.</Affiliation></AffiliationInfo></Author><Author ValidYN="Y"><LastName>Lundeberg</LastName><ForeName>Joakim</ForeName><Initials>J</Initials><AffiliationInfo><Affiliation>Science for Life Laboratory, KTH Royal Institute of Technology, Department of Gene Technology, Tomtebodav&#228;gen 23, 171 65 Solna, Sweden.</Affiliation></AffiliationInfo></Author><Author ValidYN